    "summary": "1 CP, used in the opposing player's Shooting phase as an enemy unit targets one of your SEKHETAR ROBOTS units while it is no more than 12\" from one of your THOUSAND SONS PSYKER units. The targeted SEKHETAR ROBOTS unit is the target. Ranged attacks aimed at it whose Strength (S) is higher than its Toughness (T) take -1 to wound rolls. This lasts for the rest of that phase.",
